'''Frozen ground''' is a detrimental [[ground effect]] that deals [[cold damage]] [[damage over time|over time]]. It is a type of [[Cold Snap ground]].

==Trivia==
Delirium's Frozen ground shared with the same status icon graphic with [[Veritania, the Redeemer]]'s environmental debuff [[Creeping Ice]].

However, the version from the orb summoned by [[the Maven]], is the same as {{il|Vortex}}

